	depends = wget
	optdepends = yay: For AUR update support
	optdepends = paru: For AUR update support
	optdepends = pikaur: For AUR update support
	optdepends = flatpak: For Flatpak package detection and updates
	optdepends = snapd: For Snap package detection and updates
	optdepends = reflector: For automatic mirrorlist optimization
	optdepends = dunst: Required for notifications and interactive buttons in Window Managers (i3, Hyprland, etc.)
	optdepends = noto-fonts-emoji: for proper rendering of icons in desktop notifications
	optdepends = glib2: For launching applications via gio
	optdepends = dex: For launching .desktop files
